  "notes": "Formed from ⟦{発|はつ}→〜発：04026_hatsu⟧ (to emit) + ⟦{語|ご}→〜語：09841_go⟧ (word). A somewhat technical term, common in ⟦{言語|げんご}→言語：02717_gengo⟧⟦{発達|はったつ}→発達：03559_hattatsu⟧ (language development) and speech therapy.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {発語|はつご}⟦{障害|しょうがい}→障害：03228_shougai⟧: speech impairment\n- ⟦{初|はじ}めて→初めて：02932_hajimete⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{発語|はつご}: first words\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{発話|はつわ}→発話：27124_hatsuwa⟧: utterance — the more standard linguistics term\n- ⟦{発音|はつおん}→発音：01698_hatsuon⟧: pronunciation — focuses on the sounds, not the act of speaking",
